PROJECT: EtherFi

## Market Category

Primary Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol
Secondary Category: Liquid Staking Token (LST) Provider
Sector: DeFi (Decentralized Finance)
Sub-sector: Restaking Infrastructure / Liquid Staking Derivatives
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama EtherFi, https://defillama.com/protocol/etherfi]; (HIGH) [Messari EtherFi, https://messari.io/project/etherfi/profile]; (HIGH) [Binance Research EtherFi, https://research.binance.com/en/projects/etherfi]

## Market Position

Project Stage: Growth (post-TGE, multi-chain expansion, institutional products live)
Primary Competitors: EigenLayer (restaking layer), Lido (stETH — liquid staking), Rocket Pool (rETH — liquid staking), Puffer Finance (pufferETH — liquid restaking), Renzo (ezETH — liquid restaking), Ether.fi (eETH/weETH — liquid restaking), Kelp DAO (rsETH — liquid restaking), Swell (swETH — liquid restaking), Bedrock (uniETH — liquid restaking), Mellow (mellowETH — liquid restaking), Symbiotic (restaking layer — partner + competitor), Karak (restaking layer)
Market Segment: Institutional & Retail Liquid Restaking, Multi-chain LST/LRT Distribution, Real-World Spending via EtherFi Cash
Geographic Focus: Global (Ethereum mainnet + 10 L2/L1 deployments), Asia-Pacific expansion via EtherFi Cash (EV-023)
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Restaking Category, https://defillama.com/category/Restaking]; (HIGH) [Messari EtherFi, https://messari.io/project/etherfi/profile]; (HIGH) [Binance Research EtherFi, https://research.binance.com/en/projects/etherfi]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Blog V2, https://blog.ether.fi/etherfi-v2-liquid-restaking/]; (MEDIUM) [EV-018, EV-023 dari Phase 3 History]

