## Liquidity

Liquidity Source: CEX (Centralized Exchange)
Major Liquidity Venue: Binance (ETHFI/USDT primary pair), Coinbase (ETHFI/USD), OKX (ETHFI/USDT), Bybit (ETHFI/USDT), Gate.io (ETHFI/USDT), KuCoin (ETHFI/USDT)
DEX: Uniswap V2/V3 (ETHFI/WETH, ETHFI/USDC), potential Curve pools (unverified)
Bridge Liquidity: weETH cross-chain liquidity via canonical bridges (Arbitrum Bridge, Optimism Portal, Base Bridge) + third-party bridges (LayerZero, Wormhole, Hyperlane) — bridge TVL tidak diagregasikan secara publik per bridge
Status: Live — CEX liquidity concentrated pada Binance dan Coinbase; DEX liquidity di Uniswap Ethereum mainnet
Sources: (HIGH) [CoinMarketCap ETHFI Markets, https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/etherfi/markets/]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama EtherFi, https://defillama.com/protocol/etherfi]; (HIGH) [Binance ETHFI Trading, https://www.binance.com/en/trade/ETHFI_USDT]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Bridging, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging]; (MEDIUM) [LayerZero Docs, https://docs.layerzero.network]; (MEDIUM) [Wormhole Docs, https://docs.wormhole.com]

