## Competitor Landscape

Competitor: Lido
Category: Liquid Staking Protocol (LST)
Difference: Lido fokus liquid staking murni (stETH) tanpa native restaking integration; EtherFi = liquid staking + native restaking (EigenLayer + Symbiotic) + multi-chain weETH + institutional vaults + real-world spending (EtherFi Cash)
Market Segment: Retail & Institutional Staking, DeFi Composability
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Lido, https://defillama.com/protocol/lido]; (HIGH) [Lido Docs, https://docs.lido.fi]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]

Competitor: Rocket Pool
Category: Liquid Staking Protocol (LST)
Difference: Rocket Pool = decentralized node operator network untuk Ethereum staking (rETH); EtherFi = permissionless operator marketplace (ULN) + restaking delegation ke EigenLayer/Symbiotic + multi-chain
Market Segment: Decentralized Staking, Node Operator Network
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Rocket Pool, https://defillama.com/protocol/rocket-pool]; (HIGH) [Rocket Pool Docs, https://docs.rocketpool.net]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs ULN, https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node]

Competitor: Puffer Finance
Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol (LRT)
Difference: Puffer = native liquid restaking pada EigenLayer (pufferETH) dengan validator ticket mechanism; EtherFi = broader restaking (EigenLayer + Symbiotic) + multi-chain weETH + vaults + cash product
Market Segment: EigenLayer Native Restaking, Retail Restaking
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Puffer, https://defillama.com/protocol/puffer-finance]; (HIGH) [Puffer Docs, https://docs.puffer.fi]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Restaking, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking]

Competitor: Renzo
Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol (LRT)
Difference: Renzo = ezETH (liquid restaking token) dengan Actively Validated Services (AVS) curation; EtherFi = eETH/weETH dual token model + multi-AVS (EigenLayer + Symbiotic) + ULN operator marketplace + vaults
Market Segment: Liquid Restaking, AVS Curation
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Renzo, https://defillama.com/protocol/renzo]; (HIGH) [Renzo Docs, https://docs.renzoprotocol.com]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]

Competitor: Ether.fi
Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol (LRT)
Difference: Nama serupa tapi project berbeda — Ether.fi (dengan titik) adalah competitor langsung dengan eETH/weETH; EtherFi (tanpa titik) adalah project ini. PERHATIAN: Phase 1-7 semua merujuk pada "EtherFi" (tanpa titik) sebagai project ini. Jika ada project "Ether.fi" terpisah, itu competitor.
Market Segment: Liquid Restaking, LST/LRT
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Ether.fi, https://defillama.com/protocol/ether-fi]; (HIGH) [Ether.fi Website, https://www.ether.fi]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Website, https://www.ether.fi] — CATATAN: Nama project di Phase 1 adalah "EtherFi" tapi website resmi adalah ether.fi — kemungkinan ini project yang sama. Perlu verifikasi.

Competitor: Kelp DAO
Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol (LRT)
Difference: Kelp = rsETH dengan multi-AVS support (EigenLayer + Karak); EtherFi = EigenLayer + Symbiotic + ULN + vaults + cash
Market Segment: Multi-AVS Restaking, Institutional
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Kelp, https://defillama.com/protocol/kelp-dao]; (HIGH) [Kelp Docs, https://docs.kelpdao.xyz]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Symbiotic, https://docs.ether.fi]

Competitor: Swell
Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol (LRT)
Difference: Swell = swETH dengan restaking ke EigenLayer + rollup (Swell L2); EtherFi = multi-chain weETH (bukan appchain) + Symbiotic + ULN + vaults + cash
Market Segment: Restaking + Rollup, Liquid Restaking
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Swell, https://defillama.com/protocol/swell]; (HIGH) [Swell Docs, https://docs.swellnetwork.io]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]

Competitor: Bedrock
Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol (LRT)
Difference: Bedrock = uniETH dengan multi-chain deployment (seperti weETH) + RockX validator; EtherFi = ULN permissionless operators + Symbiotic + vaults + cash
Market Segment: Multi-chain Liquid Restaking, Institutional
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Bedrock, https://defillama.com/protocol/bedrock]; (HIGH) [Bedrock Docs, https://docs.bedrock.technology]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Multi-chain, https://docs.ether.fi]

Competitor: Mellow
Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol (LRT)
Difference: Mellow = vault-based restaking optimizer (mellowETH) yang allocate ke best AVS; EtherFi = native LST/LRT issuer + vaults sebagai produk terpisah
Market Segment: Restaking Vault Optimizer, Yield Optimization
Sources: (HIGH) [DefiLlama Mellow, https://defillama.com/protocol/mellow]; (HIGH) [Mellow Docs, https://docs.mellow.finance]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults]

Competitor: Symbiotic
Category: Restaking Layer (Protocol)
Difference: Symbiotic = restaking infrastructure layer (seperti EigenLayer); EtherFi = consumer protocol yang build di atas Symbiotic + EigenLayer. Symbiotic adalah dependency DAN competitor potensial jika launch native LRT.
Market Segment: Restaking Infrastructure, AVS Marketplace
Sources: (HIGH) [Symbiotic Docs, https://docs.symbiotic.fi]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Symbiotic, https://docs.ether.fi]; (HIGH) [EV-013 Phase 3 History]

Competitor: Karak
Category: Restaking Layer (Protocol)
Difference: Karak = multi-asset restaking layer (BTC, ETH, stablecoin); EtherFi = ETH-focused liquid restaking. Karak belum launch native LRT tapi potential competitor.
Market Segment: Multi-asset Restaking, Universal Restaking
Sources: (HIGH) [Karak Docs, https://docs.karak.network]; (MEDIUM) [DefiLlama Karak, https://defillama.com/protocol/karak]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]

Competitor: EigenLayer
Category: Restaking Layer (Protocol)
Difference: EigenLayer = primary restaking layer; EtherFi = largest consumer protocol di atas EigenLayer. EigenLayer tidak issue LST/LRT sendiri; dependency kritis.
Market Segment: Restaking Infrastructure, AVS Marketplace
Sources: (HIGH) [EigenLayer Docs, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama EigenLayer, https://defillama.com/protocol/eigenlayer]; (HIGH) [EV-007 Phase 3 History]

## Narrative Position

Narrative: Restaking
Status: Main Narrative
Evidence: EtherFi V2 positioned as "Liquid Restaking Protocol" (EV-008), native integration dengan EigenLayer (EV-007) dan Symbiotic (EV-013), TVL ranked top 3 liquid restaking protocols
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi Blog V2, https://blog.ether.fi/etherfi-v2-liquid-restaking/]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama Restaking Category, https://defillama.com/category/Restaking]; (HIGH) [Messari EtherFi, https://messari.io/project/etherfi/profile]; (HIGH) [Binance Research EtherFi, https://research.binance.com/en/projects/etherfi]

Narrative: Liquid Staking Token (LST)
Status: Main Narrative
Evidence: eETH sebagai LST rebasing, weETH sebagai non-rebasing wrapper untuk DeFi composability — core product sejak V1 (EV-005, EV-006)
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs eETH, https://docs.ether.fi/tokens/eeth]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs weETH, https://docs.ether.fi/tokens/weeth]; (HIGH) [DefiLlama Liquid Staking Category, https://defillama.com/category/Liquid+Staking]

Narrative: Multi-chain / Interoperability
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: weETH deployed di 10+ chain (EV-018 batch 1 & 2) — Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast, Linea, Scroll, zkSync Era, Mantle, BNB Chain
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Multi-chain, https://docs.ether.fi]; (HIGH) [EV-018 Phase 3 History]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Bridging, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging]

Narrative: Real-World Assets (RWA) / DeFi x TradFi
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: EtherFi Cash — kartu kredit non-kustodial terhubung ke restaked ETH yield (EV-010, EV-023), spending yield di dunia nyata
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Cash, https://cash.ether.fi]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Blog Cash, https://blog.ether.fi]; (MEDIUM) [EV-010, EV-023 Phase 3 History]

Narrative: Institutional DeFi / Therapeutic-grade Restaking
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: EtherFi Vaults — institutional-grade vault dengan risk management, multi-AVS allocation, withdrawal queue (EV-011, EV-026)
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Blog Vaults, https://blog.ether.fi]; (MEDIUM) [EV-011, EV-026 Phase 3 History]

Narrative: Permissionless Operator Network / Decentralized Validation
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: Ultra Light Node (ULN) — marketplace permissionless untuk operator node (EV-012), desentralisasi validator set
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs ULN, https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Blog ULN, https://blog.ether.fi]; (MEDIUM) [EV-012 Phase 3 History]

Narrative: Yield Trading / Fixed Income DeFi
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: Pendle integration untuk PT/YT trading eETH/weETH yield (EV-014)
Sources: (HIGH) [Pendle Docs, https://docs.pendle.finance]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Blog Pendle, https://blog.ether.fi]; (HIGH) [EV-014 Phase 3 History]

Narrative: Governance / DAO
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: EtherFi DAO dengan ETHFI token governance, fee switch proposal (EV-017, EV-020, EV-024)
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Governance, https://docs.ether.fi/governance]; (HIGH) [Snapshot EtherFi, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]; (HIGH) [EV-017, EV-020, EV-024 Phase 3 History]

Narrative: Modular / EigenLayer AVS
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: Integrasi dengan EigenLayer AVS spesifik (EigenDA) (EV-021), Symbiotic networks
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EigenLayer Docs AVS, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz/avs]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Blog AVS, https://blog.ether.fi]; (MEDIUM) [EV-021 Phase 3 History]

