## BUAT RINGKASAN

Market Stage: Growth (post-TGE, multi-chain live, institutional products live, DAO active)
Primary Category: Liquid Restaking Protocol
Competitor Count: 12 direct competitors teridentifikasi (Lido, Rocket Pool, Puffer, Renzo, Ether.fi, Kelp, Swell, Bedrock, Mellow, Symbiotic, Karak, EigenLayer) + broader LST/LRT landscape
Major Narrative: Restaking (Main), Liquid Staking Token (Main), Multi-chain/Interoperability (Secondary), RWA/DeFi x TradFi (Secondary), Institutional DeFi (Secondary), Permissionless Operator Network (Secondary), Yield Trading (Secondary), Governance/DAO (Secondary)
Trading Availability: 6 CEX (Binance, Coinbase, OKX, Bybit, Gate.io, KuCoin) + Uniswap DEX, perpetual di 5 CEX
Adoption Metrics Available: TVL, eETH/weETH supply, unique stakers, ETHFI volume, market cap, validator count estimate, developer count — DAU, daily txns, bridge volume, cross-chain messages TIDAK tersedia publik

## Open Threads

- Exact weETH contract address per chain (10+ chain) — tidak diagregasikan di docs.ether.fi/bridging; perlu query per explorer
- Bridge TVL dan volume per bridge (canonical vs LayerZero vs Wormhole vs Hyperlane) — tidak ada dashboard terpusat
- Daily Active Users (DAU) metric — tidak dipublikasikan resmi; Dune dashboard komunitas mungkin ada tapi tidak terverifikasi official
- Daily transaction count (staking/unstaking/wrapping/bridging) — tidak diagregasikan publik
- Cross-chain message count (LayerZero/Wormhole/Hyperlane) — perlu query per explorer
- Exact ULN operator count real-time — tidak ada dashboard publik; blog launch mention ~150+ tapi current count unknown
- Ether.fi vs EtherFi naming confusion — website resmi ether.fi tapi project disebut "EtherFi" di Phase 1-7; apakah project yang sama atau ada competitor terpisah "Ether.fi"? Perlu verifikasi
- ETHFI token market cap rank exact — berfluktuasi harian, range #150-#200 perlu real-time check
- Fee switch proposal (EV-024) outcome — apakah passed dan implemented; Snapshot vote result perlu diverifikasi
- Tokenomics distribution breakdown (team, investor, community, treasury %) — Phase 6 confirm semua tidak diungkap resmi
- Vesting unlock schedule real-time — investor/team unlock yang mempengaruhi circulating supply dan selling pressure
- Institutional adoption metrics untuk EtherFi Vaults — TVL vaults, jumlah institutional partner, AUM tidak dipublikasikan
- EtherFi Cash adoption — jumlah kartu terbit, transaction volume, geographic reach tidak dipublikasikan
- Grant program / hackathon sponsorship — tidak ditemukan program resmi EtherFi untuk developer eksternal
- Formal verification status smart contracts — apakah ada kontrak yang diverifikasi formal (Certora, Halmos) selain audit
- Insurance coverage untuk slashing risk — apakah Vaults/protocol membeli coverage dari Nexus Mutual, Unslashed, dll
- Regulatory status di yurisdiksi utama (US, EU, Singapore) — legal opinion, compliance framework tidak dipublikasikan
- Revenue data historis (bulanan/kuartalan) — Phase 5 confirm tidak diungkap; perlu on-chain query via Dune/custom indexer
- Treasury composition dan address — DAO treasury address tidak terverifikasi publik; composition unknown
- Competitor "Ether.fi" (dengan titik) — apakah project terpisah atau nama yang sama; DefiLlama memiliki "Ether.fi" sebagai protocol terpisah